# Only the server and what it builds from go into the image context.
**
!src/F3M.Server/**
!src/F3M.Client/**
!src/F3M.Shared/**
!src/nuget-packages/**
!src/NuGet.Config
!src/global.json

# Host build output would clash with the Linux restore in the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Runtime data and local settings: the database, the catalog signing key and developer credentials.
**/Storage/**
!**/Storage/.gitignore
**/appsettings.Development.json
